      "accessibilityData": {
        "stepFreeAccessCoverage": "partialStation",
        "stepFreeAccessNote": "<p>This station has been classified as a step-free access category<strong> B3</strong> station. <strong>This means that there is some step-free access, this may be in one direction only.</strong> More information on the step-free classification system can be found at <a href=\"https://www.orr.gov.uk/media/10955\" title=\"\"><u>https://www.orr.gov.uk/media/10955</u></a>\u00a0 </p><p><strong>Please note: Platform 1 is the only platform with step free access at Worcester Shrub Hill. Platform 2 and 3 can only be accessed as step free with station staff assistance. </strong></p><p>The assistance meeting point is at the ticket office during available opening times. When station staff aren't available, the assistance meeting point is on the platform that your train is due to depart. When the train has arrived, please attract the attention of a staff member onboard, who will help you to board the train.\u00a0 </p>"
